{
  "note": "D-126. Matchers for two deterministic_replies rows (match_mode = matcher). The vocabulary is the vertical's; each tenant writes its own bodies. tomorrow_hours answers ONLY when the message says tomorrow AND asks about working, closing or a holiday, and names no other intent (price, booking, address). holiday_hours_note never answers alone: it appends the tenant's holiday line to whatever is served.",
